    "description": "Well, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Round stone well sunk into the ground: a one-course circular cobblestone rim round a round pool, dark oak posts and windlass with a chain, a bench and a barrel on the grass; L2 adds the spruce gable roof, crank, pulley and a lantern, L3 a water tub, a flower pot, moss, lanterns and flowers. 9 x 7 x 6 (one layer in the ground), water by the decoration step. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, cauldron, cornflower, dandelion, dark_oak_slab, lever, moss_carpet, oxeye_daisy. Decoration step adds: item, potted_plant, water, water_cauldron.",
    "changes": "For your note (\"still not circular\", \"rim only 1 block tall\"): the rim is one block tall (the well is sunk, the water level with the grass) and is now a real circle, 7 across with two steps at every corner, round a round pool. The barrel, a new bench and the tub stand on the grass apart from the ring, so nothing squares it off. The roof overhangs its posts by one block all round; level 1 gets a bench and poppies, level 3 more flowers.",
